              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochan ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa otïlilö kegh ompöwölo ochan tïlil. Amosïmnyon kegh ompö kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo westegho ngwïny. ",
          "type": "text",
